33:T20c3,{
  "product_name": "油气管道巡检无人机",
  "product_name_en": "Oil & Gas Pipeline Inspection Drone",
  "summary": "油气管道巡检无人机是一款专为长输油气管道全生命周期完整性管理设计的专业化智能巡检系统。系统主要由高可靠性工业级飞行平台、多类型机载巡检载荷和一体化地面控制终端三部分组成，能够在沙漠、戈壁、高山、雪域等复杂地形及交通不便区域，高效完成油气管道大范围巡护、隐患排查、应急处置及施工监理等复杂场景下的巡检与数据采集任务。",
  "summary_en": "The Oil & Gas Pipeline Inspection Drone is a professional intelligent system designed for full-lifecycle integrity management of long-distance pipelines. It consists of a high-reliability industrial-grade flight platform, multi-type airborne payloads, and an integrated ground control terminal. It efficiently performs large-scale patrols, hazard troubleshooting, emergency response, and construction supervision in complex or inaccessible terrains such as deserts, high mountains, and snowy regions.",
  "key_application": "应用领域：长输油气管道常态化巡护、泄漏检测；沙漠、戈壁等复杂地形风险隐患排查（违规施工、占压、打孔盗油等）；现场取证与施工监理。",
  "key_application_en": "Routine patrol and leak detection for long-distance pipelines; hazard troubleshooting in complex terrains (illegal construction, occupation, illegal tapping); field evidence collection and construction supervision.",
  "key_parameter_1": "最大续航时间: 180min（空载）",
